    "note": "THREE FOOTPRINTS, AND WHICH ONE IS RIGHT DEPENDS ON THE QUESTION. A dimension overlay wants `with_porch` -- that is the building a buyer sees. A setback check needs BOTH `with_porch` and `overall`: many jurisdictions measure to the wall but cap eave projection under a separate rule, so using one for both over-constrains siting or under-reports the encroachment."
